From 2884f153e9a5539c1e210bbee9900b48130f38b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:23:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Pages: Access Restrictions over IPv6, MLO off keeps every
 band, Auto refresh is kept

- System: the Access Restrictions text says that IPv6 access to the web interface and SSH is
  blocked while the list is on, and the page asks first when it is open over IPv6.
- MLO: switching MLO off read only the first band entry of the main network and could write a list
  without the other bands. It reads every entry, and writes nothing when there is none.
- Firewall (Status, Rule Status) and System Log: the Auto refresh choice is kept per browser.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/www/Reaper_Firewall.asp | 13 +++++++++++--
 release/src/router/www/Reaper_Log.asp      |  6 +++++-
 release/src/router/www/Reaper_MLO.asp      | 19 +++++++++++++------
 release/src/router/www/Reaper_System.asp   | 10 +++++++++-
 4 files changed, 38 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/release/src/router/www/Reaper_Firewall.asp b/release/src/router/www/Reaper_Firewall.asp
